<title>PHILIPPINES: New investors buy into Alcorn.</title>
<headline>New investors buy into Alcorn.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Filipino banker Edgardo Espiritu and a group of American and Malaysian investors have bought into local exploration firm Alcorn Petroleum Minerals Corp, a company official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Espiritu and another representative of the group were elected to the seven-man board at the firm's annual stockholders' meeting.</p>
<p>Alcorn president Eduardo Hernandez said Espiritu's group held a minority stake but they may decide to take a bigger equity later on.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (63 2) 841-8936, Fax 817-6267</p>
